u-county-firefighters-museum","subject_type":"street_or_district","entity_name":"Nassau County Firefighters Museum and Education Center","title":"Practice Fire-Safety Skills","subtitle":"Davis Avenue • Museum Row","notes":"Focus your visit on the interactive safety simulations, then examine the historic firefighting vehicles and equipment.","short_summary":"Immersive drills connect practical fire safety with Nassau County firefighting history.","evidence_claim":"Nassau County tourism describes interactive fire-safety simulations and displays ranging from horse-drawn steamers to ladder trucks at this Museum Row facility.","source_url":"https://nassaucountytourism.com/get-inspired/arts-culture/museum-row-long-island-a-family-destination/","source_title":"Museum Row Long Island: A Destination for Everyone in the Family","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Nassau+County+Firefighters+Museum%2C+1+Davis+Avenue%2C+Uniondale%2C+NY+11553","access_notes":"Confirm current public hours and admission with the museum before departing; the county lists the facility at 1 Davis Avenue.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"mitchel-athletic-complex","subject_type":"street_or_district","entity_name":"Mitchel Athletic Complex","title":"See the Stadium and Fields","subtitle":"Charles Lindbergh Boulevard • Nassau Hub","notes":"Check for a public event before going; ordinary field use requires a permit even though the complex opens daily.","short_summary":"A county stadium complex used for track, lacrosse, soccer, football, and organized events.","evidence_claim":"Nassau County identifies Mitchel as a 49-acre complex at 1 Charles Lindbergh Boulevard with a stadium and fields for several sports.","source_url":"https://www.nassaucountyny.gov/2642/Mitchel-Athletic-Complex","source_title":"Mitchel Athletic Complex | Nassau County